  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.94,
      "e": 10.94,
      "text": "It was a beautiful day so we decided to go out fishing, you know, friends and family."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.94,
      "e": 15.02,
      "text": "So we ended up catching some sandaps."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.02,
      "e": 21.46,
      "text": "We ended up by the aquarium and finally our engine, boat engine gave up."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.46,
      "e": 25.22,
      "text": "So we tried all our best but we couldn't."
    },
    {
      "s": 25.22,
      "e": 31.5,
      "text": "So we had to call the coast guard and finally they came up and told us away."
    },
    {
      "s": 31.5,
      "e": 37.06,
      "text": "The other thing was we were not too far away so we weren't scared of anything."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.06,
      "e": 41.7,
      "text": "We disclosed by to the wharf so it was cool."
    },
    {
      "s": 41.7,
      "e": 50.62,
      "text": "We had everything that is required to have in a boat like fire extinguishers, flares,"
    },
    {
      "s": 50.62,
      "e": 55.66,
      "text": "flashlights, life jacket, throwballs, everything that is required."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.66,
      "e": 57.34,
      "text": "Yeah, we had everything."
    },
    {
      "s": 57.34,
      "e": 60.38,
      "text": "So where did you guys run into trouble?"
    },
    {
